  "name": "Prostate-MRI-US-Biopsy",
  "alternateName": [
    "prostate_mri_us_biopsy"
  ],
  "description": "This dataset was derived from tracked biopsy sessions using the Artemis biopsy system, many of which included image fusion with MRI targets. Patients received a 3D transrectal ultrasound scan, after which nonrigid registration (e.g. \u201cfusion\u201d) was performed between real-time ultrasound and preoperative MRI, enabling biopsy cores to be sampled from MR regions of interest. Most cases also included sampling of systematic biopsy cores using a 12-core digital template. The Artemis system tracked targeted and systematic core locations using encoder kinematics of a mechanical arm, and recorded locations relative to the Ultrasound scan. MRI biopsy coordinates were also recorded for most cases. Please see the Prostate-MRI-US-Biopsy page to learn more about the images and to obtain any supporting metadata for this collection.",
  "url": "https://cancer-data-showcase.vercel.app/datasets/idc-prostate-mri-us-biopsy",
